   (CC BY 3.0 IGO), GeoNames (CC BY 4.0, www.geonames.org) and Wikidata (CC0).
   The test cases contain place names from the HDX datasets listed in
   docs/SOURCES.md, each under its own licence (CC BY, CC BY-IGO or CC0).

   The villages, towns and camps in data/gazetteer/settlements.json come from
